  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "奶喙tī佗位"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>何明洲</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">眠床是海</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">嬰仔是魚</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">奶喙是細隻蝦仔tī海--裡走tsông</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">掠bē著ê魚仔&nbsp; &nbsp; 激動ê目屎哭入海</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">眠床是山</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">嬰仔是烏熊仔囝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">奶喙是蜂蜜藏tī深山林內</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">揣bē著ê熊仔囝&nbsp; &nbsp; 目頭kat-kat sa無tsáng</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">眠床是宇宙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">嬰仔是小王子</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">奶喙是獨一無二ê玫瑰蹛tī遙遠ê B612</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">等bē著ê小王子&nbsp; &nbsp; 放聲大哭看向天</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">惜惜&nbsp; &nbsp; 惜惜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿母pha網掠蝦</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿爸peh樹揣蜜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">爸母做伙kā小王子攬tiâu-tiâu</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī恬靜ê暗暝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">夢見hit蕊獨一無二ê玫瑰</span></p><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgBovshtz-ZPg2uAGuilKjtg9j5AtcQX3p_Xs6hTiCOpB79fcCylUL7PjPFKKaAg30rTk_rYjD93CJcvSSf7Iev7ZSehM1BmVfcnnAZGq5zvWrESKxbxYHGBcnwcwvsHuHfkhatISB0yLv219-r5OdYNX02m9WvprbcEdBmvqA3Z_BoWPM5mCTuCt-RQQ=s1421\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgBovshtz-ZPg2uAGuilKjtg9j5AtcQX3p_Xs6hTiCOpB79fcCylUL7PjPFKKaAg30rTk_rYjD93CJcvSSf7Iev7ZSehM1BmVfcnnAZGq5zvWrESKxbxYHGBcnwcwvsHuHfkhatISB0yLv219-r5OdYNX02m9WvprbcEdBmvqA3Z_BoWPM5mCTuCt-RQQ=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgzwAvFXOMLVt_WmKP6pS42y5ksviCcwNHmq5FjSxLN_np7t-wlZe91eJyWgVleXo_NCetED47Ee2Ll49SaOMwlpYwCRKaZUQiT9jC5L0m6_GR2aEnAAeZhgxajonGsA9L2pumf99Ch2VXkkpLQgUk_hM_WNNB-KriMioWZP0By2BVNRHluZ6Aae9xE-w=s3036\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgzwAvFXOMLVt_WmKP6pS42y5ksviCcwNHmq5FjSxLN_np7t-wlZe91eJyWgVleXo_NCetED47Ee2Ll49SaOMwlpYwCRKaZUQiT9jC5L0m6_GR2aEnAAeZhgxajonGsA9L2pumf99Ch2VXkkpLQgUk_hM_WNNB-KriMioWZP0By2BVNRHluZ6Aae9xE-w=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><br /><div><br /></div></div><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%